  "body": "Attention Family Home Buyers & Downsizers!\r\nAll agents welcome. \r\n\r\nOur owners have relocated, creating an exciting opportunity for you to secure this lovely, recently renovated weatherboard home.\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented and bathed in all-day sunshine, this three-bedroom, two-bathroom home offers an enviable combination of comfort, style and convenience. Simply move in, unpack and enjoy everything this wonderful property has to offer.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in a peaceful location, you'll be just 950m from Waiake Beach, while being conveniently close to local shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities. With easy motorway access, everything you need is right at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a quality family home, or simply a beautiful home in a sought-after North Shore location, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nOur owners are ready to move on, so don't delay - homes of this calibre in such a desirable location are rarely available for long.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing. \r\n\r\nTo download the property files please visit:- https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/94E3",
